Z||000000||TN Fieros||08-18-2001||01:10 AM||||Here's a few pics from our get-together last weekend. There will be more posted on the website but just wanted to post a few here.<P>We intended to meet at the Food Court at Rivergate Mall but the mall was swamped so we ended up across the street in the Target parking lot. <P>We had six cars show up:<BR>Keith's 88 3.4 GT<BR>Alan's 88 coupe<BR>Tim's 86 GT<BR>Tim G's 84 V8 coupe<BR>Phillip's 84 coupe<BR>Dale's 84 Indy<P>After hanging out and talking cars we went into the cool of the Food Court for some lunch and then took a cruise to Moss-Wright Park. The line of little cars got some attention, including a guy who worked for Ford who was out cruising in his factory original 1953 Ford pickup. He had to come over and talk Fieros for a while.<P>Looking forward to next month!<P>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/tnfieros/cars2.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/tnfieros/cars5.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/tnfieros/group1.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/tnfieros/group2.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/tnfieros/group3.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/tnfieros/cars6.jpg">    <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TNFiero[1].gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by TN Fieros (edited 08-20-2001).]||||reg||7
