Z||000003||Butter||08-20-2001||04:33 PM||||Everone,<BR>I had a great time.  I really must fix my column problem I got.  I must get my wipers wipin'.  I decided to take a detour so's we could eat at this little bar and grill on the other side of the river off of hwy 70 (Tamera's).  I grow'd up with some of those folk's and I like there Onion rings.  I run into a little rain on the way back but nothing the Rain X could'nt take care of.  I'll try to make the next one if possible.<p>[This message has been edited by Butter (edited 08-20-2001).]||||reg||7
Z||000004||Songman||08-20-2001||10:37 PM||||The date for next month will be September 8. Start making plans now. I'll be planning it for somewhere around Nashville unless someone steps up with another plan...<P>Larry will be bringing his 87 GT 308 kit car to the next meeting so you won't want to miss it. And I'll bring the T-top instead of the Indy. Gotta enjoy it before the weather starts getting cold!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||7
